  data: {
    LLM: 'Discard high-pip tiles when you must discard; keep a variety of halves in hand to maximize the chance of playing when it is your turn.\n\nPlay defensively. Lead high tiles like 6-6 or 6-5 to force others to discard; keep variety of halves so you can match when the turn returns.\n\nThe 2 half has only seven tiles total; attack by leading 5-2 with 2 open, then playing 2-2 to force another round of discards. Short suits can be monopolized or duo-polized.',
